<title>UK: EU sugar import levies.</title>
<headline>EU sugar import levies.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>EU sugar representative prices and additional duties on imports effective October 31.</p>
<p>			 Representative price    Additional duty</p>
<p>			 (Ecus per 100 kg net)   (Ecus per 100 kg net)</p>
<p>			   New	 Prev	   New	  Prev</p>
<p> Raw cane sugar     20.73     22.06	  5.94-11.44 5.27-10.50</p>
<p> Raw beet sugar     20.73     22.06	  5.75-10.92 5.08-10.07</p>
<p> Coloured sugar     25.59     26.28	  12.49	12.09</p>
<p> White sugar	  25.59     26.28	  7.92	 7.57</p>
<p> Other syrups	  0.26	0.26	  0.39	 0.39</p>
</text>
